Feature: Comprehensive API Security Testing # features/api_security.feature:1
  As a QA engineer
  I want to test various API security scenarios
  So that I can ensure comprehensive security coverage
  @smoke @authentication
  Scenario: Valid token should validate successfully  # features/api_security.feature:10
    Given I have a valid token                        # features/steps/auth_steps.py:29
    When I send a request to "/api/users/me"          # features/steps/auth_steps.py:76
    Then the response should validate token           # features/steps/auth_steps.py:132

  @smoke @authentication
  Scenario: Admin token should validate successfully  # features/api_security.feature:16
    Given I have an admin token                       # features/steps/auth_steps.py:29
    When I send a request to "/api/users/me"          # features/steps/auth_steps.py:76
    Then the response should validate token           # features/steps/auth_steps.py:132

  @smoke @authentication
  Scenario: User token should validate successfully  # features/api_security.feature:22
    Given I have a user token                        # features/steps/auth_steps.py:29
