    Then the response should expect 401      # features/steps/auth_steps.py:132

  @authorization @role-based
  Scenario: Admin token should allow access to admin endpoint  # features/api_security.feature:40
    Given I have an admin token                                # features/steps/auth_steps.py:29
    When I send a request to "/api/admin/users"                # features/steps/auth_steps.py:76
    Then the response should access allowed                    # features/steps/auth_steps.py:132

  @authorization @role-based
  Scenario: User token should be denied access to admin endpoint  # features/api_security.feature:46
    Given I have a user token                                     # features/steps/auth_steps.py:29
    When I send a request to "/api/admin/users"                   # features/steps/auth_steps.py:76
    Then the response should access denied                        # features/steps/auth_steps.py:132

